tik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Cave of the Casterwills]]\"","value_text":"\"Cave of the Casterwills\"","links":[{"target_title":"Cave of the Casterwills","label":"Cave of the Casterwills","target_id":"huntik:page:6979","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cave_of_the_Casterwills","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A6979"}]}],"start":0,"end":190}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"The spell was used by [[White]] and [[Mallory]] as they attacked the Huntik team as they swam to the shore of [[England]]. They later used the spell to attack them in the [[Crystal Caves]]. [[Lok Lambert]] was knocked unconscious after being hit by White's Kindlestrike. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}\n\n[[Lucas Casterwill]] used the spell to attack the Huntik team in the [[Casterwill Library]]. He later used it to blast [[Venomaster]] onto the roof of car. [[Lane]] then used it against [[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]]. {{source|Chasing Void}}\n\n[[Sophie Casterwill]] began using the spell in [[Klaus' bookshop]], in order to fight the [[Silent Soldiers]]. {{source|The Blood Spiral}} It then became one of her favored spells, with her using it on multiple occasions. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}} {{source|The Spiral War}} {{source|Gremlow Infestation}}\n\n[[LeBlanche]] used the spell from a [[Huntik Foundation]] jet to hit a [[Casterwill Hunter]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\nUpon his return from the ashes, [[Dante Vale]] used Kindlestrike to fight [[the Betrayer]] in their final showdown. {{source|Dante's Return}}","text":"The spell was used by White and Mallory as they attacked the Huntik team as they swam to the shore of England. They later used the spell to attack them in the Crystal Caves. Lok Lambert was knocked unconscious after being hit by White's Kindlestrike. [Cave of the Casterwills]\n\nLucas Casterwill used the spell to attack the Huntik team in the Casterwill Library. He later used it to blast Venomaster onto the roof of car. Lane then used it against Wilder's Suits. [Chasing Void]\n\nSophie Casterwill began using the spell in Klaus' bookshop, in order to fight the Silent Soldiers. [The Blood Spiral] It then became one of her favored spells, with her using it on multiple occasions. [Boys Will Be Seekers] [The Spiral War] [Gremlow Infestation]\n\nLeBlanche used the spell from a Huntik Foundation jet to hit a Casterwill Hunter. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nUpon his return from the ashes, Dante Vale used Kindlestrike to fight the Betrayer in their final showdown. [Dante's Return]"},{"heading":"Users","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[Mallory]]\n* [[Lane]]\n* [[LeBlanche]]\n* [[Lucas Casterwill]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Teien Casterwill]]\n* [[White]] \n\n{{Clear}}","text":"• Dante Vale\n• Mallory\n• Lane\n• LeBlanche\n• Lucas Casterwill\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Teien Casterwill\n• White"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS2E29 White Mallory Kindlestrike.png\nS2E31 Lucas Kindlestrike.png\nS2E31 Lane Kindlestrike.jpg\nS2E36 Sophie Kindlestrike.png\nS2E40 Dellix Lane Kindlestrike.png\nS2E41 Sophie Kindlestrike 2.png\nS2E41 Sophie Kindlestrike.png\nS2E51 Lucas Kindlestrike Sunlock.png\nS2E52 Dante kindlestrike.png\n</gallery>","text":""},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Frappe de feu\n|DUT = IJzelstreek|POR=Raio Incendiário}}\n\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":"French: Frappe de feu\nDutch: IJzelstreek\nPortuguese: Raio Incendiário"}],"full_text":"Kindlestrike is a Casterwill family spell that creates a high-powered beam of blue energy that can stun or defeat an enemy.\n\nHistory\n\nThe spell was used by White and Mallory as they attacked the Huntik team as they swam to the shore of England. They later used the spell to attack them in the Crystal Caves. Lok Lambert was knocked unconscious after being hit by White's Kindlestrike. [Cave of the Casterwills]\n\nLucas Casterwill used the spell to attack the Huntik team in the Casterwill Library. He later used it to blast Venomaster onto the roof of car. Lane then used it against Wilder's Suits. [Chasing Void]\n\nSophie Casterwill began using the spell in Klaus' bookshop, in order to fight the Silent Soldiers. [The Blood Spiral] It then became one of her favored spells, with her using it on multiple occasions. [Boys Will Be Seekers] [The Spiral War] [Gremlow Infestation]\n\nLeBlanche used the spell from a Huntik Foundation jet to hit a Casterwill Hunter. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nUpon his return from the ashes, Dante Vale used Kindlestrike to fight the Betrayer in their final showdown. [Dante's Return]\n\nUsers\n\n• Dante Vale\n• Mallory\n• Lane\n• LeBlanche\n• Lucas Casterwill\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Teien Casterwill\n• White\n\nGallery\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Frappe de feu\nDutch: IJzelstreek\nPortuguese: Raio Incendiário","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E50_Sophie_Kindlestrike.png\n| aura  = Blue\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Casterwill family]] <br> [[Dante Vale]]\n| first = \"[[Cave of the Casterwills]]\"\n}}'''Kindlestrike''' is a [[Casterwill family]] spell that creates a high-powered beam of blue energy that can stun or defeat an enemy.\n\n== History ==\nThe spell was used by [[White]] and [[Mallory]] as they attacked the Huntik team as they swam to the shore of [[England]]. They later used the spell to attack them in the [[Crystal Caves]]. [[Lok Lambert]] was knocked unconscious after being hit by White's Kindlestrike. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}\n\n[[Lucas Casterwill]] used the spell to attack the Huntik team in the [[Casterwill Library]]. He later used it to blast [[Venomaster]] onto the roof of car. [[Lane]] then used it against [[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]]. {{source|Chasing Void}}\n\n[[Sophie Casterwill]] began using the spell in [[Klaus' bookshop]], in order to fight the [[Silent Soldiers]]. {{source|The Blood Spiral}} It then became one of her favored spells, with her using it on multiple occasions. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}} {{source|The Spiral War}} {{source|Gremlow Infestation}}\n\n[[LeBlanche]] used the spell from a [[Huntik Foundation]] jet to hit a [[Casterwill Hunter]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\nUpon his return from the ashes, [[Dante Vale]] used Kindlestrike to fight [[the Betrayer]] in their final showdown. {{source|Dante's Return}}\n\n== Users ==\n* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[Mallory]]\n* [[Lane]]\n* [[LeBlanche]]\n* [[Lucas Casterwill]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Teien Casterwill]]\n* [[White]] \n\n{{Clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS2E29 White Mallory Kindlestrike.png\nS2E31 Lucas Kindlestrike.png\nS2E31 Lane Kindlestrike.jpg\nS2E36 Sophie Kindlestrike.png\nS2E40 Dellix Lane Kindlestrike.png\nS2E41 Sophie Kindlestrike 2.png\nS2E41 Sophie Kindlestrike.png\nS2E51 Lucas Kindlestrike Sunlock.png\nS2E52 Dante kindlestrike.png\n</gallery>\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Frappe de feu\n|DUT = IJzelstreek|POR=Raio Incendiário}}\n\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Blue-aura spells","Casterwill family magic","Magic","Offensive spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:3280","status":"resolved","target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wi